יָּה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 31:27\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(20,31,27)\">Prov 31:27</ref> <highlight>she keepeth watch</highlight> of (with accusative); plural <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עֵינֵי י</bdbheb> <bdbheb>צֹפוֺת רָעִים וְטוֺבִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 15:3\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(20,15,3)\">Prov 15:3</ref> elsewhere as substantive <highlight>watchman</highlight>, absolute<bdbheb>צֹפֶה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 13:34\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(10,13,34)\">2Sam 13:34</ref> +; plural <bdbheb>צֹפִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 14:16\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(9,14,16)\">1Sam 14:16</ref> +, suffix <bdbheb>צֹפָיו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 56:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"56\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"56\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,56,10)\">Isa 56:10</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup> <bdbheb>צפו</bdbheb>), <bdbheb>צֹפַיִךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 52:8\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(23,52,8)\">Isa 52:8</ref> — <ref ref=\"1Sam 14:16\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(9,14,16)\">1Sam 14:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 13:34\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(10,13,34)\">2Sam 13:34</ref> + 8 t. Samuel Kings, <ref ref=\"Ezek 33:2\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(26,33,2)\">Ezek 33:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 33:6\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(26,33,6)\">Ezek 33:6</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Isa 52:8\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(23,52,8)\">Isa 52:8</ref>, so in <bdbheb>שְׂדֵה צֹפִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 23:14\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"23